WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.380
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.390
Brother...

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.700
You freed me from my prison of hate.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.980
Thank you.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:19.060
Sorry, Brother.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.550
We lost.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:26.720
Ai, your goal will endanger children!

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.070
I won't allow that!

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.850
I like your style, Onizuka.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.560
Go Onizuka, just give up.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.700
No, I won't give up.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:47.690
There are children waiting for me.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:50.530
I'm Go Onizuka.

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:54.660
I'll keep standing back up!

00:00:55.480 --> 00:01:04.750
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:32.710
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:42.660
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:47.900
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:56.440
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:01:56.700 --> 00:02:01.580
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:07.260
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:11.560
calling  With invisible wings

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:22.170
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:38.140
I summon Gouki Suprex!

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:41.940
Suprex's effect!

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:44.940
Appear, Gouki Guts!

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:49.010
Link Summon!

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:53.250
Link 2 Gouki Heel Ogre!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:58.120
By going to the graveyard, Guts 
and Riscorpio's effects activate!

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.460
I add Gouki cards from my deck to my hand.

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:04.540
I activate the spell card, Gouki Re-Match!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.930
Resurrect, Guts and Twistcobra!

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:09.900
Guts's effect activates.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:16.320
But Heel Ogre negates and 
destroys that effect.

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:22.430
Then I Special Summon a Gouki 
Link Monster from my graveyard!

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.370
Resurrect, Master Ogre!

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:31.860
Though I used TAi Strike to destroy 
it, but he resurrected that Link 4.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.330
Link Summon!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.530
Link 2 Gouki Jet Ogre!

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:43.420
Suprex's effect activates 
by going to the graveyard.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:47.310
I add Gouki Diver from my deck to my hand!

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.010
I Link Summon again!

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:55.330
Appear, Link 3 Gouki Thunder Ogre!

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:02.840
He made a big comeback.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.520
I was acting confident, but Ai is in a pinch.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:10.760
Twistcobra's effect activates 
by going to the graveyard.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.500
I add one Gouki to my hand.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:17.620
Then Jet Ogre's effect 
activates from my graveyard.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:23.530
All Goukis on the field gain 500 
ATK until the end of the turn!

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:27.710
Thunder Ogre's effect!

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:34.190
When it's in the Monster Zone, I can summon 
for a second time next to its link.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:37.220
Appear, Suprex!

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.740
Suprex's effect activates!

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:44.180
I Special Summon Gouki Diver from my hand!

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:48.860
Appear!  The circuit of fortitude!

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:52.030
The summoning conditions 
are at least two Goukis!

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:56.980
I set Diver and Link 3 Thunder 
Ogre in the Link Markers!

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.110
Unleash your power!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.080
Destroy the mountain and open my path!

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.690
Link Summon!

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:12.250
Appear, Link 4 Gouki The Powerload Ogre!

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.490
What?  You're still bringing out Link 4s?

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:20.230
When Powerload is Link Summoned, 
only its own effects can affect it.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:23.470
Diver's effect activates from my graveyard.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:28.070
I add a non-Diver Gouki 
card in my deck to my hand.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:30.910
Powerload Ogre's effect!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:37.120
Other than its own, it gains 200 
ATK for every Gouki's Link Marker.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:41.200
I activate the spell card, Gouki Face Turn!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:44.570
This card destroys one Gouki card!

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.900
I destroy Suprex!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:51.300
Then I Special Summon a 
Gouki from my graveyard!

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:54.200
Resurrect, Thunder Ogre!

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:59.120
Powerload Ogre's other effect activates!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:05.440
By tributing a Link Monster, I destroy a 
card on the field for each of its Link Markers!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.180
I tribute Link 3 Thunder Ogre.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.650
I can destroy three cards.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:18.660
First, I'll destroy those two 
monsters in defense position!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:22.460
Then that set card!

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:27.780
Now you only have Dark Templar on your field!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:32.370
I'll destroy your ace and defeat you!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.320
This is bad bad bad!

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:36.610
His duel is really bad for me!

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:41.880
Battle!  Master Ogre attacks Dark Templar!

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.890
You have no monsters left to protect you.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.490
Don't do it!  I don't want to die!

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:57.940
This'll end you.

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:00.870
Powerload Ogre attacks you directly!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.740
Powerload Impact!

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.180
He did it!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.330
He beat him!

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.820
What?

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.360
That was close.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:24.380
I was really about to die.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:29.790
Why do you still have LP?

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:35.030
I activated the effect of my 
set card that you destroyed.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.430
What?

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.920
The trap card was Ai's Hymn.

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:46.740
By banishing this card from my graveyard, I 
gain 200 LP for every @Ignister in the graveyard.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:52.850
There are four @Ignisters in my 
graveyard, so I regained 800 LP.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:56.750
That's why I had a few LP left.

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:02.930
If you didn't destroy that 
card, I'd be dead by now.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:10.840
Ai's ability to avoid danger 
is higher than expected.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.440
I end my turn.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:19.410
Jet Ogre's effect ends, so Master 
Ogre's ATK return to normal.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.740
You're impressive, Go Onizuka.

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:26.930
If I let my guard down for 
an instant, I'll lose.

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:30.020
I must defeat you this turn.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.910
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:36.490
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Aidle Reborn!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:39.730
I Speical Ssummon an @Ignister 
from my graveyard.

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.700
Resurrect, Doshin!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.490
Doshin's effect activates!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:51.620
I return Dark Templar in my 
graveyard to my Extra Deck.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:56.240
I add Ai Love Yousion in my deck to my hand.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:59.630
Then I activate Ai Love Yousion!

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:04.220
I Fusion Summon by sending the 
required monsters to the graveyard!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:11.500
And if there's an Earth Link Monster in your 
graveyard, I can use it to Fusion Summon.

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:17.400
But since I Link Summoned Powerload, 
it's not affected by your cards!

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:19.560
I know that.

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:23.780
I fuse Doshin and your Master Ogre!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.910
The earth sings!

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:29.250
Bless the destruction giant's birth!

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:31.650
Fusion Summon!

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:35.620
Earth Golem @Ignister!

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:42.530
Earth Golem!

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.020
Here I go!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:48.000
Let's see which is stronger: Your 
fortitude or my seriousness!

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:55.920
Since Master Ogre left the field, 
Powerload Ogre loses 800 ATK.

00:09:57.080 --> 00:10:01.580
Battle!  Earth Golem attacks Powerload Ogre!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.520
Earth Golem's effect!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:09.380
During battle, its original ATK double!

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:13.420
4600 ATK?

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:15.830
You have 1200 LP.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:17.900
You can't survive this strike.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:22.630
Take this!  Rock Bomb!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.240
After I've come this far...

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:30.740
I won't lose!

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:34.210
I banish Diver from my graveyard 
to activate its effect!

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.450
I take 0 battle damage!

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:40.180
But Powerload Ogre is destroyed.

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.140
Diver's effect!

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:57.500
The attacking monster loses 600 
ATK, and it has to attack again!

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:02.810
Even with that effect, I still win.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:05.280
No, I'm not giving up!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.550
I activate my Skill, Fighting Spirit!

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:13.790
I Special Summon all Goukis that 
were destroyed in battle this turn!

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:17.060
Resurrect, Powerload Ogre!

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:20.060
I see.  You'll use that to survive.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:22.540
Then I'll shave away your LP!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.130
Bring it on!

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:28.870
Fine!  Earth Golem attacks Powerload Ogre!

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:32.140
Earth Golem's ATK are doubled!

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:37.900
Onizuka will take 600 
damage from this attack!

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:40.210
Go Onizuka will have LP left!

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:44.050
Take my serious punch, Go Onizuka!

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:49.090
I was waiting for this moment!

00:11:49.090 --> 00:11:50.090
What?

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:55.460
I send Gouki Double Impact from my hand 
to the graveyard to activate its effect!

00:11:55.460 --> 00:12:02.530
By showing you the Headbatt in my hand, 
Powerload gains ATK equal to its ATK!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:07.510
But only its own effects 
can affect Powerload Ogre.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:09.570
Did you forget?

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:13.630
You destroyed The Powerload 
Ogre that I Link Summoned!

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:19.050
I see!  You used your Skill to 
resurrect this Powerload Ogre!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:24.520
That's right.  So other effects 
can affect this Powerload Ogre.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.970
You calculated this!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:32.490
The Gouki Headbatt in my hand has 800 ATK!

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:36.040
Powerload gains 800 ATK!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:38.870
What?

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:44.400
Powerload Ogre has 200 more 
ATK than Ai's monster!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:48.050
Ai has 200 LP left.  If this succeeds...

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:51.520
You planned to use this 
attack to make a comeback!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.450
See that, Ai?

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:57.990
I've returned to my path 
with my duel of fortitude!

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:02.730
Your duel is so dangerous 
that it gives me shivers!

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:07.040
But I can't afford to lose here either.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:10.940
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, 
Aidle Reborn from my graveyard!

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:17.740
I banish this card and Ignister AiLand from 
my hand to return TAi Strike to my hand!

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:21.950
What?  You're using that card now?

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.950
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, TAi Strike!

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:29.530
@Ignister's ATK become the 
same as your monster's!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.540
Now Earth Golem has 3600 ATK!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:38.740
After the battle, the controller
 of the destroyed monster

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:41.970
takes damage equal to its original ATK.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:45.090
You're planning for us to both lose?

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.690
No, Go Onizuka.

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:50.120
I can't have a tie.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:52.660
So only you will be pummeled!

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.550
That's how Ai will strike you!

00:13:54.550 --> 00:14:01.090
When Earth Golem is Fusion Summoned, 
I take 0 damage that turn!

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.420
What?

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:08.100
Onizuka, my friends can't 
recover like you have.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:10.710
Because they're gone.

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:11.860
Ai...

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:15.670
His ability to deal with 
problems is incredible.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.800
Go, Earth Golem!

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.640
Rock Bomb!

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:35.680
Go Onizuka, I don't hate you.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.820
If I could be like you...

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.820
Go Onizuka lost too!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.600
Playmaker!  Soulburner!  Revolver!

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:54.810
Ai and Roboppi are heading towards Zaizen!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:58.940
I'll head there soon!

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:02.710
Cyberse Clock Dragon attacks you directly!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.350
Violet Chimera!

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:15.660
Go, Borrelsword Dragon!

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:26.610
You're strong.  Copies can't defeat you.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.420
But we've stalled you enough.

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:40.730
Huh?  No one's here, Bro.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:43.790
Yeah.  Just as I expected.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.360
Did they log out?

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:50.040
No.  They're definitely in the network.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:54.870
They know it's more dangerous 
to be in the real world.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:10.850
I see.  I now understand.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.090
Huh?  No one's here.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.330
Where's Ai and Roboppi?

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.290
And Zaizen and Blue Maiden?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:29.330
Zaizen and Blue Maiden were 
never here to begin with.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:30.960
What?  But...

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:34.640
They were transmitting 
from a different location.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.340
Where are the real Zaizens?

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.330
Somewhere no one can reach.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.860
An airplane.

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:56.830
If they're 12000 meters above 
Den City, no one can reach them.

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:59.830
There are no SOLtiS in the plane.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:06.300
And other than via the special algorithm I 
created, they're cut off from outside networks.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.770
So it's impossible to invade.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:12.740
That's right.  Unless you go there directly.

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.790
I found you, Zaizen.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:25.100
As of now, everything's normal.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:27.760
I must protect Executive Director Zaizen!

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.000
What?

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.070
What happened?

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.840
Cargo door destroyed!

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:39.040
Emergency repairs!

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:42.040
What happened?

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.180
You're the one who attacked the Queen!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.310
Yes.  I'm Ai.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:57.680
An hour before I attacked Zaizen,
 a plane owned by SOL Technologies

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.920
took off to an unknown destination.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:03.630
Did you think I wouldn't find out?

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.200
I've been waiting for you, Ai.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:18.480
You were inside Go Onizuka's Duel Disk.

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:21.980
I'm Pandor, created by Revolver.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.380
Revolver created an AI?

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:29.140
So I'm not the only one who's changed.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:35.340
Since we're both AI, 
let's discuss peacefully.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.760
That won't work, Ai.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.660
Your programs don't work on me.

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:46.800
What an annoying thing 
Professor Revolver created.

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:50.690
I sense strong hostility from inside you.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:54.010
Reading others' souls is bad taste.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.360
That is my job.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:19:00.020
Whatever.  Let's settle this in a duel.

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:03.260
Of course.  I was thinking 
that from the start.

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:05.990
I already have all the data on you.

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:11.400
We can fight inside the network, 
but since we're here...

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.460
Let's take this outside, punk!

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:21.010
I always wanted to say that line.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:24.910
I can't be wasting time, so let's do this.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:27.510
I'm ready.

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.280
Duel!

00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:31.380
My turn!

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:34.040
I summon Pikari @Ignister!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:41.780
I add Ignister AiLand 
from my deck to my hand.

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.030
Link Summon!

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:48.450
Link 1 Linguriboh!

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:52.700
I activate Ignister AiLand!

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:57.440
I Special Summon a Level 4 or 
lower @Ignister from my hand!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:20:00.440
Appear, Achichi @Ignister!

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:03.240
Same as usual.

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:08.390
First Pikari, leading to Ignister AiLand 
and Linguriboh.  That is efficient.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.730
Thank you for your praise.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.520
As you expect, I'll keep going!

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:17.490
I Special Summon Hiyari @Ignister!

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:21.830
When my monster is in the 
Extra Monster Zone...

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:26.770
...I can Special Summon this card 
from my hand next to its link!

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:30.770
Appear!  The circuit that guides the dark!

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:35.750
The summoning conditions are three Cyberses, 
which includes a Dark Attribute!

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.890
The creation of dark shadows!

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:41.760
